#: app/templates/about.html:6
msgid ""
"The Graduation Project Archival System (GPAS) is a web-based digital "
"repository developed for the Arab Open University — Kuwait Branch. It "
"centralises the storage, discovery, and dissemination of graduation "
"projects produced by the Faculty of Computer Studies."
